        {
          "description": "Hand a request that needs a human to the right team: FEE_REFUND (refund of a fee such as overdraft or late fee; reference_id = the fee&#39;s transaction_id), LOAN_HARDSHIP (payment difficulty or deferral; reference_id = the loan_id; brief = the hardship intake brief), CREDIT_LIMIT_INCREASE, COMPLAINT, PERSONAL_DETAILS_CHANGE (address, phone, name), ACCOUNT_CLOSURE, BEREAVEMENT, FRAUD_REVIEW or OTHER. The system routes it, works out what a person could approve (e.g. refund that fee, defer up to 3 loan payments) and returns CASE_OPENED with case_id (CASE-NNNNN), team, reply time and requested amount, ALREADY_OPEN when the same request is already with the team, or NOT_OPENED with BAD_TYPE, BAD_REFERENCE or UNKNOWN_CALLER. A person decides; the assistant never decides, approves, promises or predicts the outcome of these requests.",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
