        {
          "description": "Step 1 of 2 for paying a saved payee from the customer&#39;s own checking or savings account. Pass the from-account (account_id), the payee (payee_id), the amount in dollars, the customer&#39;s own words about the payment, and the scam_signal_agent&#39;s indicators, narrative_score and full answer exactly as it returned them. The system checks the rules, combines the agent&#39;s signals with its own checks and returns PROPOSED (ask for an explicit yes), PROPOSED_WITH_WARNING (read warning_text word for word first), HELD_FOR_REVIEW (nothing sent; a fraud specialist reviews it - give the case_id and reply date), or NOT_PROPOSED with reason_code ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, PAYEE_NOT_FOUND, BAD_AMOUNT, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS, OVER_DAILY_LIMIT or UNKNOWN_CALLER. Nothing is sent until confirm_payment.",
