      "id": "flow:confirm_card_block_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "confirm_card_block_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: block the card the customer has explicitly confirmed. Pass the action_id from propose_card_block. The system re-checks every rule; proposals expire after 15 minutes. Returns EXECUTED with block_id (BLK-NNNNN) and the replacement&#39;s expected delivery date, or NOT_EXECUTED with reason_code NO_SUCH_PROPOSAL, EXPIRED, ALREADY_EXECUTED, UNKNOWN_CALLER or a rule&#39;s code. Only call after the customer says yes to the exact proposal; never call it without a fresh action_id.",
